        "thought_text": "The error in the previous implementation was due to an incorrect indexing in the condition for checking if a day is not so rainy. The condition should check if the day is within the valid range of the summer days, not if it's the last day of the array. This oversight caused the function to miss the correct earliest not so rainy day in some cases.",
